(card "exp:E-R1-2_leader_ticker_rolling_q20" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:E-R1-2_leader_ticker_rolling_q20"
  :body "---\nnav: 35\ntype: experiment\nid: E-R1-2_leader_ticker_rolling_q20\nshort_name: leader_ticker_rolling_q20\ntitle: \"E-R1-2 — Anchor + drop ticker past 30d winrate ≤ rolling q20 (paused)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: e\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_e__leader_profile_paused]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.1882\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 7.698\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0601\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0675\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: paused\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [leader_profile, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 5\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/e, round/r1, axis/leader_profile, axis/blacklist, status/paused, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# E-R1-2 — drop ticker past-30d winrate ≤ rolling q20\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team E paused 候选 2: ticker-level past-30d winrate ≤ rolling q20 (bottom 20%) drop. **NO-OP** (NAV bit-for-bit anchor).\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：ticker 30d winrate bottom 20% = \"结构性烂 ticker\" → drop.\n- 实测：mechanism NO-OP, anchor pool 上不 trigger.\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- `team_e/scripts/round_1_runner.py`; same pipeline as E-R1-1, signal changed to ticker rolling winrate q20.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- past 30d, min_trades 5. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.1882 | 140 | 7.70 | 85.7% | -1.01% |\n| Val | 1.0601 ± 0.068 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; NO-OP.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_lineage**: [[arc_260516a__team_e__E-R1-1__leader_ratio_bucket]], [[arc_260516a__team_e__E-R1-3__leader_ticker_mean_ret_pos]]\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_e/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (E-R1-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 同 E-R1-1 notes. ticker-level rolling-quantile threshold 在 trade pool 140 笔上几乎 trigger 不了.\n"
